<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p001:m0000" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">文安王皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p001:m0006" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">寶明</persName>琅邪臨沂人也祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p001:m0015" ref="yfa_tz5_3ge">韶之</persName>吳興太守父<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p001:m0022" ref="e8b_fms_9mk">曄之</persName>太宰祭酒</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">宋世<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0002" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>為<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0005" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh">文惠太子</persName>納<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0010" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">后</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0011" ref="fjv_3dz_w0m">桂陽賊</persName>至<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0015" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>在新亭傳言已沒宅復為人所抄掠<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0031" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh">文惠太子</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0035" ref="x3q_cqm_dup">竟陵王子良</persName>奉<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0041" ref="262_b8f_4ie_AA">穆后</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0043" ref="v9d_w9p_fij">庾妃</persName>及后挺身送后兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0052" ref="009_19m_qao">昺</persName>之家事平乃出建元元年為南郡王妃四年為皇太子妃無寵太子為宮人製新麗衣裳及首飾而后牀帷陳設故舊釵鑷十餘枚永明十一年為皇太孫太妃<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0114" ref="iop_ybd_afm">鬱林</persName>即位尊為皇太后稱宣德宮贈后<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0129" ref="e8b_fms_9mk">父</persName>金紫光祿大夫母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0137" ref="vvf_ol4_jvc">桓氏</persName>豐安縣君其年十二月備法駕謁太廟<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0154" ref="w4m_9tw_147">高宗</persName>即位出居<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0160" ref="so9_dzz_czr">鄱陽王</persName>故第為宣德宮永元三年<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0173" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">梁王</persName>定京邑迎后入宮稱制至禪位天監十一年薨年五十八葬崇安陵諡曰安后兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-wyd:p002:m0206" ref="otc_2vr_c4y">晃</persName>義興太守</p>
</text>
